+    /**
+     * Commons Codec 1.13 accepts non-zero bits which are discarded by the
+     * final Base64 quantum (for example, {@code AB==}).  Ciphertext is
+     * produced by {@link Base64#encodeBase64String(byte[])}, so require the
+     * canonical padded form before handing input to that decoder.
